Limited assurance conclusion
Our procedures selected depended on our understanding of the information subject to limited assurance and other engagement circumstances, and our consideration of areas where material misstatements are likely to arise. In carrying out our engagement, we: •	 assessed the suitability of the criteria used by the entity in preparing the information subject to limited assurance;

